# Build context for deploy/Dockerfile.* — secrets and local state never enter an image (CLAUDE.md §8). Every pattern
# is recursive: an env file anywhere in the tree stays out, not only at the root.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.env
!**/.env.example
!**/*.env.example
# Signing material of the native shell: a key file must never reach a build stage (ADR-0055).
**/*.p12
**/*.jks
**/*.keystore
**/*.p8
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.pfx
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dist-native
**/.turbo
**/.next
**/coverage
apps/business
.git
.github
*.log
